{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16809","headline":"冬至夜郡斋宴别前华阴卢主簿 · 张登","name":"冬至夜郡斋宴别前华阴卢主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虎宿方冬至，鸡人积夜筹。\n相逢一尊酒，共结两乡愁。\n王俭花爲府，卢谌幄内璆。\n明朝更临水，怅望岭南流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张登","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}